{"candidateAnswer":"His love for books and imaginative storytelling","evidence":"[D13:1 | 1:50 pm on 13 October, 2023] Tim: Hey John! It's been ages since we last talked. Guess what? Last week I went to a Harry Potter conference in the UK - it was incredible! There were so many people who shared the same love of HP as me, it was like a magical family. I felt so inspired and like I got a new lease of life. I love how my passion for fantasy stuff brings me closer to people from all over the world, it's pretty cool.","itemId":"urn:uuid:6e8744f7-a9ab-5b44-8f33-b6109d28e7fc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d2a8656ea647509f8ea335a06fdf20c260d2ea5c74d2f616355d1d47950e467a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What passion does Tim mention connects him with people from all over the world?","referenceAnswer":"passion for fantasy stuff","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d2a8656ea647509f8ea335a06fdf20c260d2ea5c74d2f616355d1d47950e467a"}}]}